---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the Peanut Buster Parfait at DQ?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The Peanut Buster® Parfait ($4.99, 710 cal) is alternating layers of DQ soft serve, salted roasted peanuts, and hot fudge sauce served in a parfait cup. It has been on the DQ menu since 1968 and is one of the longest-running items in fast food history."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the DQ Banana Split?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The DQ Banana Split ($5.69, 520 cal) features a fresh split banana topped with three scoops of DQ soft serve, pineapple topping, strawberry topping, and hot fudge, finished with whipped topping and a maraschino cherry. It is comfortably shareable between two people."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Classic Treats Menu & Prices 2026" description="Complete DQ Classic Treats menu with 2026 prices. Vanilla cone $2.39, Peanut Buster Parfait $4.99, Banana Split $5.69, Dilly Bars, Cupfections and.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />


<Breadcrumbs items={[{"name": "Home", "href": "/"}, {"name": "Menu", "href": "/categories"}, {"name": "DQ Classic Treats 2026"}]} />

<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Cones · Sundaes · Dilly Bars · Parfaits</span>
<h1>Dairy Queen Cones, Sundaes &amp; Classic Treats Menu</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <p class="lead"><strong>A small vanilla cone at Dairy Queen costs about $2.39, a Dilly Bar about $1.99 and a medium sundae about $3.79.</strong> These are DQ’s original treats: soft serve cones, dipped cones, sundaes, the Peanut Buster Parfait, Banana Split, Dilly Bars and Buster Bars. They are sold at every DQ, including Treat-only stores.</p>
    <p>Below are all the classic treats with typical prices and calories. Looking for something blended? See the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard menu</a>. Curious whether DQ soft serve counts as ice cream? We <a href="/blog/dairy-queen-ice-cream-vs-soft-serve">explain the difference</a>.</p>


    <h2>Classic Treats — Full Menu with Prices &amp; Calories</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/vanilla-soft-serve-cone">Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</a> (Small)</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$2.39</td><td>220</td><td>Classic DQ soft serve on a wafer cone with a perfect curl</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/chocolate-dipped-cone">Chocolate Dipped Cone</a> (Small)</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.19</td><td>320</td><td>Soft serve dipped in a crispy chocolate shell</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Crunchin' Cookie Dipped Cone</strong> <span class="badge" style="font-size:0.7rem;margin-left:4px;">Seasonal</span></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>350</td><td>Soft serve dipped in a chocolatey cookie-crunch coating</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/hot-fudge-sundae">Hot Fudge Sundae</a> (Medium)</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>430</td><td>Warm fudge poured generously over DQ soft serve</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/strawberry-sundae">Strawberry Sundae</a> (Medium)</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>340</td><td>Fresh strawberry topping over DQ soft serve</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/caramel-sundae">Caramel Sundae</a> (Medium)</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>430</td><td>Rich caramel drizzled over DQ soft serve</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/peanut-buster-parfait">Peanut Buster® Parfait</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>710</td><td>Layers of soft serve, salted peanuts, and hot fudge — since 1968</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/banana-split">Banana Split</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.69</td><td>520</td><td>Three scoops on a split banana with pineapple, strawberry &amp; fudge</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/dilly-bar">Dilly® Bar — Chocolate</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td>about 220</td><td>Round soft serve on a stick, coated in crispy chocolate shell</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/non-dairy-dilly-bar">Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>220</td><td>Dairy-free frozen dessert on a stick with chocolatey coating</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/buster-bar">Buster Bar® Treat</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>about 475</td><td>Vanilla soft serve, peanuts, and fudge — original DQ frozen bar</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/dq-sandwich">DQ® Sandwich</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$1.49</td><td>about 180</td><td>Soft serve between two chocolatey wafers — nostalgic novelty</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/brownie-oreo-cupfection">Brownie &amp; Oreo® Cupfection</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.29</td><td>720</td><td>Brownie bites and Oreo pieces layered with soft serve in a cup</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Heath® Caramel Brownie Cupfection</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.29</td><td>780</td><td>Heath toffee, caramel, and brownie pieces over soft serve</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Classic treats from lowest to highest calories</h2>
    <p>If you are monitoring calories, here is the Classic Treats lineup from lightest to most indulgent:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>DQ® Sandwich — about 180 cal ($1.49) — the lightest option</li>
      <li>Dilly® Bar Chocolate — about 220 cal ($1.99)</li>
      <li>Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar — 220 cal ($2.49)</li>
      <li>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone (Small) — 220 cal ($2.39)</li>
      <li>Chocolate Dipped Cone (Small) — 320 cal ($3.19)</li>
      <li>Strawberry Sundae (Medium) — 340 cal ($3.79)</li>
      <li>Crunchin' Cookie Dipped Cone — 350 cal ($3.49)</li>
      <li>Hot Fudge Sundae (Medium) — 430 cal ($3.79)</li>
      <li>Caramel Sundae (Medium) — 430 cal ($3.79)</li>
      <li>Buster Bar® Treat — about 475 cal ($2.49)</li>
      <li>Banana Split — 520 cal ($5.69)</li>
      <li>Peanut Buster® Parfait — 710 cal ($4.99)</li>
      <li>Brownie &amp; Oreo® Cupfection — 720 cal ($6.29)</li>
      <li>Heath® Caramel Brownie Cupfection — 780 cal ($6.29)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the Peanut Buster Parfait at DQ?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Peanut Buster® Parfait ($4.99, 710 cal) is alternating layers of DQ soft serve, salted roasted peanuts, and hot fudge sauce served in a parfait cup. It has been on the DQ menu since 1968 and is one of the longest-running items in fast food history.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the DQ Banana Split?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The DQ Banana Split ($5.69, 520 cal) features a fresh split banana topped with three scoops of DQ soft serve, pineapple topping, strawberry topping, and hot fudge, finished with whipped topping and a maraschino cherry. It is comfortably shareable between two people.</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;">For the full DQ menu including Blizzards, Stackburgers, Chicken Baskets, DQ Cakes, and deals, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p>
  </div></section>

</Layout>
